01:46.237 --> 01:49.287
Mmmmm, it's so sour!

01:49.287 --> 01:50.947
That looks tasty.

01:50.947 --> 01:51.787
Oh?

01:52.197 --> 01:53.787
Here, take one.

01:53.787 --> 01:54.787
Thank you.

01:54.787 --> 01:59.207
"Munch. Shudder!" went the princess in the mirror.

01:59.207 --> 02:02.087
It's so sour!

02:02.087 --> 02:03.217
Then, all of a sudden...

02:06.837 --> 02:07.967
Oh?

02:07.967 --> 02:10.557
There were two real princesses!

02:10.847 --> 02:15.267
That's how there are now two princesses.

02:15.267 --> 02:16.517
And right about now, they're both still saying...

02:17.977 --> 02:19.857
"It's so sour!"

02:22.067 --> 02:25.987
Miss Landlady's Secret

02:25.987 --> 02:26.067
Who the hell are you?
Miss Landlady's Secret

02:26.067 --> 02:28.067
Who the hell are you?

02:28.067 --> 02:30.067
Huh?

02:30.787 --> 02:32.287
Don't "huh" me.

02:32.287 --> 02:34.827
I'm asking you who the hell are you?

02:34.827 --> 02:36.167
Right...

02:36.167 --> 02:37.957
What happened to her all of a sudden?

02:39.377 --> 02:43.127
Can't you say something!?

02:49.547 --> 02:51.597
It's really noisy.

02:51.597 --> 02:53.387
That's true.

02:54.267 --> 02:56.267
This is disturbing my sleep.

02:56.267 --> 02:57.397
Oh, Tama-chan.

02:57.397 --> 02:58.647
Damn you!

03:01.857 --> 03:05.067
Can't you even tell me your own name?

03:05.067 --> 03:06.397
You've gotta be a thief!

03:06.777 --> 03:09.237
A th-thief?

03:09.867 --> 03:12.617
Why is she so angry?

03:14.947 --> 03:16.037
Could it be...

03:18.497 --> 03:22.087
You've got some nerve to try to break into my house.

03:22.087 --> 03:22.917
Are you...

03:22.917 --> 03:23.377
I'm sorry!
Are you...

03:23.377 --> 03:24.257
I'm sorry!

03:24.257 --> 03:28.127
But I really didn't mean to do anything weird.

03:28.127 --> 03:29.257
Anything weird?

03:29.257 --> 03:31.177
I mean, um, how should I put it...

03:33.757 --> 03:36.097
When did you...

03:36.767 --> 03:37.477
Yes?

03:39.937 --> 03:41.437
You pervert!

03:41.437 --> 03:43.067
Why!?

03:43.067 --> 03:44.727
Um, what? What's going on here?

03:44.727 --> 03:45.147
Really...
Um, what? What's going on here?

03:45.147 --> 03:46.067
Really...

03:46.067 --> 03:47.897
What do you mean by "what"!?

03:47.897 --> 03:50.067
This perverted thief tried to do something nasty to my body!

03:50.067 --> 03:51.737
What are you talking about, Saki-chan?
This perverted thief tried to do something nasty to my body!

03:51.737 --> 03:52.157
What are you talking about, Saki-chan?

03:52.157 --> 03:52.487
Can't you at least say you're sorry or something!?

03:52.487 --> 03:55.327
Saki-chan...?
Can't you at least say you're sorry or something!?

03:55.327 --> 03:56.247
Can't you at least say you're sorry or something!?

04:04.457 --> 04:08.467
If you were a new resident here, you should've told me sooner!

04:08.917 --> 04:11.007
Man, that was embarrassing.

04:14.967 --> 04:18.847
You sure you didn't do anything to me?

04:18.847 --> 04:19.937
Y-Yes.

04:21.397 --> 04:22.937
It's all good, then!

04:22.937 --> 04:25.317
Come, let's forget about what happened in the past!

04:25.317 --> 04:26.527
Right, Shiratori!?

04:28.737 --> 04:30.737
Man, it's been a while since I've seen you two.

04:30.737 --> 04:33.237
Momono, Tamami, how've you been?

04:33.237 --> 04:33.947
Great.

04:34.327 --> 04:36.657
I'm glad you look good too, Saki-chan.

04:36.657 --> 04:37.827
Yeah.

04:37.827 --> 04:39.657
You're still the same.

04:39.907 --> 04:41.417
What the heck?

04:41.417 --> 04:42.917
What in the world is going on?

04:42.917 --> 04:43.417
All right, then.
What in the world is going on?

04:43.417 --> 04:44.417
All right, then.

04:44.417 --> 04:47.377
We need to have a welcome party for Shiratori.

04:48.087 --> 04:50.547
Why don't you go get the snacks and drinks?

04:51.297 --> 04:52.757
Why me?

04:53.717 --> 04:56.137
What? You've got something to say about it?

04:56.137 --> 04:57.677
I'm on my way.

04:57.677 --> 04:59.727
Dash, man! Dash!

04:59.727 --> 05:01.017
Yes...

05:13.107 --> 05:15.827
Yeah, let's party hard!

05:15.827 --> 05:17.367
Ready!?

05:17.367 --> 05:18.657
I am.

05:19.077 --> 05:22.037
Really, what's going on with Miss Landlady?

05:22.037 --> 05:24.327
Why did she become so scary all of a sudden?

05:24.917 --> 05:26.037
Shiratori-kun.

05:27.417 --> 05:29.127
Oh, Momono-san.

05:29.127 --> 05:31.917
You still don't know the neighborhood very well yet, do you?

05:31.917 --> 05:35.797
I'll show you where the closest convenience store is. Come, let's go together.

05:35.797 --> 05:37.717
Momono-san...

05:40.387 --> 05:41.977
He's really a fun guy.

05:45.557 --> 05:47.107
Thank you very much!

05:53.777 --> 05:54.447
What's wrong?

05:54.987 --> 05:55.947
Are they too heavy?

05:55.947 --> 05:59.907
No, um... about the landlady...

06:00.577 --> 06:03.407
Did something happen to her?

06:04.677 --> 06:05.377
What?

06:06.787 --> 06:10.587
Sheesh, so that's what was on your mind?

06:11.707 --> 06:14.257
Didn't I warn you?

06:14.257 --> 06:17.007
About Kozue-chan's secret.

06:17.007 --> 06:17.967
Secret?

06:18.427 --> 06:22.177
You shocked her, didn't you?

06:24.687 --> 06:25.767
I guess...

06:26.687 --> 06:30.477
But how could that be related?

06:30.477 --> 06:31.897
But it is.

06:32.437 --> 06:36.607
That's the reason why she transformed.

06:39.777 --> 06:41.617
Um, you mean...

06:41.617 --> 06:43.247
You see,

06:43.247 --> 06:46.617
when she is shocked,

06:46.617 --> 06:46.867
Aobe Kozue
when she is shocked,

06:46.867 --> 06:48.497
she transforms...
Aobe Kozue

06:48.497 --> 06:49.167
...from Kozue-chan to Saki-chan.
Aobe Kozue

06:49.167 --> 06:51.127
Saki Akasaka
...from Kozue-chan to Saki-chan.

06:51.127 --> 06:53.257
...from Kozue-chan to Saki-chan.

06:54.257 --> 06:56.087
Transform?

06:56.087 --> 06:58.257
You must be kidding me.

06:58.837 --> 07:02.637
I guess it's maybe too much to ask you to believe it right away.

07:02.637 --> 07:03.427
But...

07:04.637 --> 07:07.807
After having seen all that, you should believe me, right?

07:07.807 --> 07:11.067
That I'm not lying.

07:11.067 --> 07:13.147
Quit touching me!

07:14.607 --> 07:17.107
Well, don't think about it too much.

07:17.527 --> 07:21.407
Come, we better hurry up or Saki-chan will be pissed.

07:21.407 --> 07:22.617
Oh, Momono-san!

07:23.367 --> 07:25.787
But it's so sudden.

07:25.787 --> 07:27.457
I can't believe it.

07:31.167 --> 07:32.287
You're so slow!

07:32.287 --> 07:35.837
I told you to dash, man. Dash!

07:35.837 --> 07:40.677
I can't believe it, but she really is completely different from Miss Landlady.

07:40.927 --> 07:44.387
So, to celebrate Shiratori's arrival.

07:44.387 --> 07:45.677
Cheers!

07:46.097 --> 07:47.557
This is it, right?

07:47.557 --> 07:49.267
No, I didn't forget it.

07:49.267 --> 07:50.187
It's going to be fun.

07:50.187 --> 07:50.977
Houme
It's going to be fun.

07:50.977 --> 07:52.687
Houme

07:52.687 --> 07:52.857
It's so sour!
Houme

07:52.857 --> 07:54.187
It's so sour!

07:54.607 --> 07:57.277
This is the best snack for a party.

07:57.277 --> 07:58.487
Yes, yes.

07:58.487 --> 07:59.527
Jeez, Saki-chan...

07:59.527 --> 07:59.987
Calm down and think.
Jeez, Saki-chan...

07:59.987 --> 08:01.487
Calm down and think.

08:01.487 --> 08:04.737
Maybe it's a very complicated trick.

08:04.737 --> 08:08.577
No, I don't think Miss Landlady would pull such a trick.

08:08.577 --> 08:10.417
Or maybe she has a twin sister?

08:10.417 --> 08:13.587
But she transformed right in front of my eyes.

08:16.507 --> 08:18.837
Why are you being a wimp over here?

08:18.837 --> 08:22.257
I hate wimps like you!

08:22.257 --> 08:24.217
If you are a man, act like a man!

08:24.217 --> 08:25.807
But still...

08:25.807 --> 08:29.807
Your face looks like a girl's.

08:29.807 --> 08:32.477
And your last name "Shiratori" is very girly.

08:33.607 --> 08:37.437
If you are a Virgo, that's a grand slam.

08:38.527 --> 08:38.607
Virgo
Shiratori
Girly Face

08:38.607 --> 08:42.157
Sure, I too want a more manly face.
Virgo
Shiratori
Girly Face

08:42.157 --> 08:43.657
My name is kinda...
Virgo
Shiratori
Girly Face

08:43.657 --> 08:46.367
And my constellation too. If only I had been born a month earlier...
Virgo
Shiratori
Girly Face

08:46.367 --> 08:49.247
Damn it, didn't I just tell you to quit acting like a wimp!?
Virgo
Shiratori
Girly Face

08:49.247 --> 08:49.787
Damn it, didn't I just tell you to quit acting like a wimp!?

08:49.787 --> 08:51.747
Are you listening to me!?

08:51.747 --> 08:55.497
I think he's depressed now precisely because he was listening to you.

08:55.497 --> 08:56.457
That's right.

08:57.297 --> 08:58.957
I'm such a loser...

08:59.297 --> 09:02.837
Quit bitching already.

09:03.137 --> 09:06.717
You're ruining the party.

09:10.977 --> 09:13.977
Listen to me, damn it!

09:13.977 --> 09:15.517
Don't you get it!?

09:16.477 --> 09:20.317
I guess it's best to have Saki-chan withdraw for now.

09:20.317 --> 09:22.907
Already?

09:22.907 --> 09:26.447
Shiratori-kun will move out of here at this rate.

09:27.657 --> 09:29.247
So...

09:29.657 --> 09:33.207
Hey, hey, Saki-chan, let's forget about him already and have a drink together!

09:33.207 --> 09:34.167
No.

09:34.167 --> 09:36.457
A wuss like him needs to be taught a lesson...

09:36.457 --> 09:39.507
Oh, come on, drink this.

09:44.257 --> 09:45.587
Miss Landlady?

09:51.597 --> 09:54.477
Raratori...

09:58.437 --> 10:00.437
Houme

10:05.027 --> 10:05.697
There, there.

10:05.697 --> 10:06.447
Don't do this!
There, there.

10:08.237 --> 10:11.157
She may act tough, but she has zero tolerance for alcohol.

10:11.407 --> 10:13.617
Even the smell gets her drunk.

10:15.537 --> 10:19.917
Now that Saki-chan has fallen asleep, let's call it a night.

10:21.007 --> 10:22.087
But...

10:23.127 --> 10:26.547
You don't need to worry about Kozue-chan.

10:26.547 --> 10:28.677
I will carry her to her room.

10:29.007 --> 10:34.137
And she should be back to her normal self by the time she wakes up tomorrow morning.

10:34.137 --> 10:36.057
Really?

10:37.767 --> 10:41.357
So don't think too much about it.

10:41.357 --> 10:44.147
Oh, we'll have your real welcome party some other day and make it a really big one.

10:44.567 --> 10:46.067
Bye bye.

10:50.327 --> 10:53.577
Shiratori-san was in a state of shock.

10:53.577 --> 10:54.707
Yeah.

10:54.707 --> 10:56.367
If his first day was like this,

10:57.707 --> 10:59.837
maybe it will turn out to be...

11:00.587 --> 11:02.417
...really fun!

11:02.417 --> 11:03.377
Yes.

11:09.297 --> 11:12.007
It was a long day.

11:12.467 --> 11:13.967
Good luck to you.

11:14.387 --> 11:17.057
Damn it, didn't I just tell you to quit acting like a wimp!?

11:18.897 --> 11:22.897
I won't last long if she's like that often.

11:22.897 --> 11:26.987
Besides, there are some other odd residents here too.

11:26.987 --> 11:30.907
Maybe I should start looking for another apartment.

11:30.907 --> 11:33.737
But I've already paid the deposit and everything.

11:33.737 --> 11:35.907
What should I do?

11:38.747 --> 11:41.037
Really, what should I do?

11:51.417 --> 11:54.297
That really happened?

11:54.837 --> 11:56.177
I'm so jealous!

11:56.177 --> 11:58.927
I wanted to see Saki-chan too.

11:59.387 --> 12:02.517
So you mean all that noise didn't wake you up at all?

12:02.517 --> 12:03.177
Nope.

12:03.177 --> 12:06.307
Work was hard last night, so we went to bed early.

12:06.307 --> 12:09.307
But we got three hundred imitation flowers done!

12:09.307 --> 12:11.477
Now we can live for at least three days!

12:15.067 --> 12:17.317
It feels so good to work.

12:17.317 --> 12:19.737
That's great...

12:19.737 --> 12:22.827
I'm sure Asami-chan did most of the work.

12:22.827 --> 12:23.867
But...

12:24.407 --> 12:26.957
I wonder if he will be okay...

12:27.367 --> 12:30.787
Won't he be shocked and move out of Narutakisou?

12:30.787 --> 12:34.457
If that happens, I will cheer up Kozue-chan.

12:34.957 --> 12:42.427
Well, it comes down to the amount of guts that Shiratori-kun has.

12:44.467 --> 12:45.847
Now, now...

12:51.017 --> 12:54.607
The morning came while I was thinking all night.

12:54.607 --> 12:56.397
Actually, it's almost noon.

13:12.877 --> 13:16.757
I'd better quickly decide what I'm going to do.

13:26.967 --> 13:30.437
And I thought I moved into a good apartment yesterday but...

13:34.227 --> 13:37.987
Now the day has come that I can once again talk with you like this....

13:38.987 --> 13:41.027
It's just like a dream.

13:57.457 --> 13:58.207
Oh?

14:00.167 --> 14:02.177
I thought I heard...

14:05.177 --> 14:07.507
I hid without thinking.

14:07.507 --> 14:11.597
Anyway, which personality does she have right now?

14:11.597 --> 14:14.057
She looked very serene, but...

14:14.057 --> 14:14.767
Oh?

14:15.517 --> 14:16.647
Shiratori-san.

14:17.647 --> 14:19.187
Miss Landlady!

14:19.187 --> 14:21.447
Hello, Shiratori-san.

14:21.447 --> 14:24.447
Um, is anything wrong?

14:24.447 --> 14:26.327
Oh, not really.

14:28.237 --> 14:29.997
Isn't it a beautiful day?

14:29.997 --> 14:31.907
Yeah.

14:31.907 --> 14:36.247
She does look like she's back to her normal self, but...

14:36.247 --> 14:38.417
Did you sleep well last night?

14:38.917 --> 14:41.547
Oh, you had to do your drawing.

14:41.547 --> 14:43.297
Have you made any progress?

14:44.297 --> 14:46.597
But yesterday...

14:46.927 --> 14:50.137
Yeah, a little.

14:50.137 --> 14:52.097
I see. That's great.

14:52.637 --> 14:55.477
Doesn't she remember anything about last night?

14:55.477 --> 14:56.977
Shiratori-san.

14:57.397 --> 15:01.687
So, what are you doing out here?

15:02.237 --> 15:05.527
I'm taking care of the garden.

15:05.527 --> 15:08.117
This is the best weather for gardening.

15:09.157 --> 15:10.327
The garden?

15:13.657 --> 15:16.497
There's a garden here!

15:17.207 --> 15:20.377
Yes, we'd better take care of it now.

15:20.377 --> 15:22.127
It's so... heavy!

15:22.127 --> 15:23.127
Um...

15:23.127 --> 15:23.877
Yes?

15:24.547 --> 15:26.387
Can I help?

15:29.427 --> 15:30.177
Yes!

15:34.437 --> 15:36.647
Are you okay?

15:36.647 --> 15:38.607
I'm all right.

16:20.557 --> 16:22.397
Thank you so much.

16:23.027 --> 16:25.317
You helped me a lot.

16:25.317 --> 16:27.737
I'm sure you're busy, so I'm really sorry.

16:27.737 --> 16:30.317
No, I'm really fine.

16:30.317 --> 16:33.117
So, what are you growing in this garden?

16:33.117 --> 16:35.747
Well, I don't know either.

16:36.407 --> 16:38.667
It's a surprise garden.

16:38.667 --> 16:40.247
A surprise garden?

16:40.247 --> 16:40.747
Yes.

16:41.037 --> 16:45.547
We planted all the seeds from all the fruits we have been eating.

16:45.547 --> 16:47.757
Many things like watermelon and umeboshi.

16:50.297 --> 16:53.757
I was hoping that they would all grow some day.

16:54.217 --> 16:58.477
Well, I don't think it works that way...

16:58.477 --> 16:59.727
You don't think so?

17:01.727 --> 17:03.607
Um, Miss Landlady?

17:05.567 --> 17:06.817
I kinda thought so myself!

17:07.697 --> 17:10.407
Look, it's a sprout.

17:10.987 --> 17:12.617
Really!

17:12.617 --> 17:14.117
Great.

17:15.077 --> 17:18.617
I can't wait to see what it grows up to be.

17:19.037 --> 17:22.537
I see, that's why it's a surprise garden.

17:22.537 --> 17:25.797
What kind of fruits do you like?

17:27.457 --> 17:33.177
Let's eat them together if one that you like grows here.

17:35.847 --> 17:39.307
But peaches take three years.
TL NOTE: An old Japanese Proverb says "Peaches and chestnuts take 3 years, 8 years for persimmons, citrons get demoted after 9 years, and the stupid pears take 18 years." This means there is a right time for everything and everything takes time.  Kozue takes this old proverb quite literally.  The years mentioned are not biologically correct.

17:39.307 --> 17:41.477
Persimmons take eight years.
TL NOTE: An old Japanese Proverb says "Peaches and chestnuts take 3 years, 8 years for persimmons, citrons get demoted after 9 years, and the stupid pears take 18 years." This means there is a right time for everything and everything takes time.  Kozue takes this old proverb quite literally.  The years mentioned are not biologically correct.

