17:59.957 --> 18:01.457
Shiratori-san?

18:01.457 --> 18:03.627
It's okay, Miss Landlady.

18:04.207 --> 18:07.047
I like most fruits.

18:08.337 --> 18:13.087
So I'll be looking forward to the day it will bear fruit.

18:14.847 --> 18:15.797
Yes!

18:15.797 --> 18:18.137
I will take good care of it,

18:18.557 --> 18:21.887
so that it will bear delicious fruit.

18:23.267 --> 18:25.107
That's right.

18:25.107 --> 18:28.147
Everyone will have a bad day sometimes.

18:29.857 --> 18:31.067
What's the matter?

18:34.987 --> 18:35.617
Onee...

18:36.867 --> 18:40.997
I just need to think that she was in an irritated mood back then.

18:42.287 --> 18:44.327
Then it's not a big deal!

18:45.127 --> 18:45.747
Miss Landlady.

18:47.707 --> 18:48.337
Yes?

18:49.087 --> 18:50.457
Um...

18:50.457 --> 18:55.887
I should have said this yesterday, but I completely forgot.

18:55.887 --> 18:58.057
I know it's late, but...

18:58.057 --> 18:58.887
...um...

19:02.387 --> 19:05.147
...thank you for taking me in, Miss Landlady.

19:05.897 --> 19:07.267
And I'm really happy to meet you.

19:07.937 --> 19:09.397
Shiratori-san...

19:09.397 --> 19:13.197
Oh, yes, nice to meet you... too...

19:18.077 --> 19:20.537
Welcome to Narutakisou.

19:20.947 --> 19:21.867
Did that scare you?

19:21.867 --> 19:23.957
The newcomer welcome cracker.

19:23.957 --> 19:25.997
Nice to meet you too, Shiratori-kun!

19:25.997 --> 19:28.667
Yay! Nice to meet you, Onii-chan!

19:28.667 --> 19:29.547
Nice to...

19:30.207 --> 19:31.877
Nice to meet you.

19:31.877 --> 19:33.167
Tamami-chan.

19:33.167 --> 19:35.547
So you've already gotten close to him?

19:35.547 --> 19:38.927
No, not that close...

19:38.927 --> 19:40.217
Nice to meet ya.

19:45.887 --> 19:48.857
Um, they really don't have bad intentions.

19:48.857 --> 19:51.107
They just like to have fun.

19:51.857 --> 19:52.687
So...

19:53.527 --> 19:54.237
Yeah.

19:55.527 --> 19:58.237
Yes, I've decided.

19:58.817 --> 20:00.777
I don't know what will happen.

20:01.407 --> 20:03.697
And it would be a lie if I said I'm not worried at all, but...

20:05.207 --> 20:07.247
I'm looking forward to my new life here.

20:08.827 --> 20:12.917
I've decided that I will live here.

20:15.127 --> 20:16.127
Shiratori-san,

20:17.297 --> 20:18.797
I have a few words for you too.

20:21.887 --> 20:24.177
Welcome to Narutakisou...

20:36.027 --> 20:37.987
U-um...

20:41.447 --> 20:42.907
M-Miss Landlady!?

20:44.617 --> 20:46.537
Does this pattern mean...

20:53.917 --> 20:54.917
Could it be!?

21:07.847 --> 21:10.937
Yay! It's Momo-chan!

21:11.647 --> 21:13.437
Is that you, Nanako-chan?

21:13.437 --> 21:16.357
Yup! I'm Nanako!

21:16.357 --> 21:18.947
N-Nanako-chan?

21:19.567 --> 21:20.107
Huh?

21:20.107 --> 21:22.617
Let me introduce her to you.

21:23.327 --> 21:23.867
This is Kanazawa Nanako-chan.

21:23.867 --> 21:26.077
Kanazawa Nanako 6 years old
This is Kanazawa Nanako-chan.

21:26.077 --> 21:27.077
She's six years old.
Kanazawa Nanako 6 years old

21:28.537 --> 21:31.457
So, did she... again?

21:32.537 --> 21:33.957
That's right.

21:34.997 --> 21:36.457
Hey, hey, Momo-chan.

21:38.627 --> 21:41.717
Who is this?

21:43.847 --> 21:46.137
S-Seriously?

21:55.197 --> 22:01.707
One day, I drew a picture all over a canvas,
itsu no hika canvas ni e ippai

22:01.787 --> 22:07.507
a picture of 7-colored dreams.
nanairo no yume egaita

22:08.927 --> 22:15.387
When I noticed, I was a bit more grown up.
ki ga tsukeba sukoshi otona ni natte

22:15.637 --> 22:20.687
What have I found?
nani wo mitsuketandarou

22:22.647 --> 22:29.397
In this aimless daily life,
yuka ate no nai mainichi no nakade

22:29.647 --> 22:35.327
I found something that's most important.
ichiban taisetsuna koto ni kizuita

22:36.327 --> 22:42.167
Yes, it's always all right,
donna tokidemo sousa daijoubu

22:42.167 --> 22:44.417
because you are here.
kimi ga irukara

22:44.627 --> 22:50.797
Holding these unforgettable thoughts,
wasurenai kono omoi dakishimete

22:51.297 --> 22:57.137
I will start walking the path of the halted fantasy again,
mouichido togireta yume no fantasy

22:57.137 --> 23:01.767
at my own speed.
aruitemiyou boku no speed de

